msgstr "ID метода платежа Lightning в BTCPay (продвинутые)"

#. translators: %1$s: BTCPay Server brand name (not translated), %2$s: default payment-method identifier, not translated (technical value).
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:166
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Only change this if your %1$s version reports a different Lightning payment "
"method identifier than the default. Leave as \"%2$s\" unless instructed "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Изменяйте это значение только в том случае, если ваша версия %1$s сообщает "
"идентификатор способа оплаты Lightning, отличный от стандартного. Оставьте "
"«%2$s», если не указано иное."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:167
#: includes/services/class-btcpay-invoice-service.php:146
msgid "BTCPay Server"
msgstr "Сервер BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:176
msgid "BTCPay Connection Test"
msgstr "Проверка подключения BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:181
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:411
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:68
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:116
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:121
msgid "lnd REST URL"
msgstr "URL lnd REST"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:183
